"""Caelestia settings: headless AdGuard Home controller and status collector.

Reads system credentials from /etc/caelestia-adblock/api-token (0640 root:wheel)
and queries the loopback AdGuard Home REST API (127.0.0.1:3053). Emits clean JSON
to stdout for services/AdBlocker.qml. Supports CAELESTIA_ADBLOCK_MOCK=1 for
sandbox UI tests without modifying host DNS.
"""

